At a feasible point \( ar x\), KKT multipliers exist exactly when \[-
abla f( ar x)\in\operatorname{cone}\{
abla g_i( ar x):i\in I( ar x)\}+\operatorname{span}\{
abla h_j( ar x):j=1,\ldots,p\}.\] Hence the multiplier set is empty exactly when this inclusion fails.
